d` from the request body instead of denying outright.\r\n\r\n## Fix\r\nIf `backfill_id` is given but matches no row, deny immediately with `403 Forbidden` (the same response a forbidden-but-existing backfill gets), instead of falling back to the body-supplied `dag_id`.\r\n\r\nCloses: #71080\r\n\r\nWas generative AI tooling used ?\r\n\r\n- [X] Yes - Claude\r\n\r\nGenerated-by: Claude following [the guidelines](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/contributing-docs/05_pull_requests.rst#gen-ai-assisted-contributions)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/71114/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/71114/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":28967701617,"node_id":"REFE_lADOAgUK288AAAABLYz-pc8AAAAGvpwMcQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/28967701617","actor":{"login":"bujjibabukatta","id":284147699,"node_id":"U_kgDOEO-_8w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/284147699?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bujjibabukatta","html_url":"https://github.com/bujjibabukatta","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bujjibabukatta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bujjibabukatta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bujjibabukatta/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bujjibabukatta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bujjibabukatta/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bujjibabukatta/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bujjibabukatta/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bujjibabukatta/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bujjibabukatta/received_events","type":"User","user_view_typ